1
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:16,700
Chen Ying.

2
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,000
The police say the scene investigation

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,480
points to suicide.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,860
But they'll keep investigating.

5
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,480
If you have no objections,

6
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:27,520
sign here
so we can proceed with cremation.

7
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:29,760
I know full well

8
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:31,810
that this world

9
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,450
isn't just black and white.

10
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,000
But I am.

11
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,640
I've always been fixated on

12
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,500
seeing things in black and white,

13
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:45,470
stubbornly

14
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,430
digging up the truth
and bringing it to light.

15
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:48,670
Mom.

16
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,200
But now,

17
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:53,860
I'm scared.

18
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:58,960
[Fire Hydrant]

19
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,010
I'm sorry.

20
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:05,180
I'm afraid that at the end of this road,

21
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,360
I'll be all alone.

22
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,970
I'm sorry.

23
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:26,200
[Morgue]

24
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:57,470
[Light the Dark]

25
00:02:57,760 --> 00:03:00,590
[Episode 4]

26
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,960
Wait here.

27
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,190
I'll walk you upstairs.

28
00:03:12,190 --> 00:03:13,160
No need.

29
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,470
I'll be right back.

30
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:20,960
Try it.

31
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:21,520
You made this?

32
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,860
Of course I did.

33
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,730
Department Chief Sun.

34
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,360
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

35
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,820
I'd like to request leave.

36
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:29,760
All right. You want time off?

37
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,079
Look.

38
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:37,140
Look.

39
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:39,590
The plant director personally
arranged for you

40
00:03:39,590 --> 00:03:41,840
to join our supply department.

41
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,560
And we

42
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,490
specifically saved a spot for you.

43
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,640
Your family situation

44
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:48,430
kept you from starting for so long.

45
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:50,630
I won't bring that up again.

46
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:53,120
We're so busy right now.

47
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,520
Everyone's working overtime.

48
00:03:55,730 --> 00:03:58,010
You keep having people cover for you.

49
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:00,240
Don't you think that's inappropriate?

50
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,470
Department Chief Sun.

51
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,030
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

52
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,170
I'm asking for leave

53
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:07,660
to bury my mother.

54
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,150
Yes.

55
00:04:10,370 --> 00:04:11,450
About your mother,

56
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,590
the chief and I both know.

57
00:04:13,690 --> 00:04:15,180
But you should also know

58
00:04:15,410 --> 00:04:16,399
our supply department

59
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:18,000
is an award-winning team.

60
00:04:18,230 --> 00:04:20,140
This is our busiest time.

61
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,560
Look.

62
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,310
Every order

63
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,440
on this desk

64
00:04:24,470 --> 00:04:26,090
is more urgent than your mother's

65
00:04:26,090 --> 00:04:26,970
cremation.

66
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,920
How about this?

67
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:30,050
You can honor your mother.

68
00:04:30,050 --> 00:04:31,260
Department Chief Sun.

69
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,280
My request is reasonable.

70
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,680
I have to take this leave.

71
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,370
Honestly, I think

72
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,190
you don't even need to ask me for leave.

73
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:40,280
Just pack up your things

74
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,470
and get out.

75
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:45,320
You're firing me?

76
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,040
The plant

77
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,670
officially hired me.

78
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,020
You have no grounds to fire me.

79
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,240
I don't know if the plant

80
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,070
has grounds to fire you.

81
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:59,750
But there's no room for you here.

82
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:01,320
Go wherever you want.

83
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:04,840
Department Chief.

84
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,000
Department Chief, you've barely eaten.

85
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,130
Have a few more bites before you leave.

86
00:05:12,630 --> 00:05:13,430
You...

87
00:05:18,590 --> 00:05:20,480
[Letter of leave]

88
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,930
Ms. Chen Ying.

89
00:05:28,310 --> 00:05:29,190
Isn't this decision

90
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:30,390
a little rash?

91
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,430
How is a young girl like you

92
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:34,090
supposed to survive out there

93
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,870
without this steady job?

94
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:38,470
How about

95
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,950
finding someone to take care of you?

96
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:41,750
That way,

97
00:05:41,830 --> 00:05:43,159
you won't have to worry about getting by.

98
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:44,220
What are you doing?

99
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:49,870
I'm not doing anything.

100
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,360
I've liked you since you first got here.

101
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:52,690
Really.

102
00:05:52,690 --> 00:05:53,159
Let go of me!

103
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:54,920
-Let go of me. I'll scream!
-Be with me. And I'll talk to the leader

104
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,240
-and get him to hire you back.
-Let go of me!

105
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,180
You pervert!

106
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,409
You creep!

107
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,770
You hit me?

108
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:05,780
Your sister

109
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,730
assaulted a government employee.

110
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,030
You have a death wish.

111
00:06:15,030 --> 00:06:16,130
What are you doing?

112
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,800
Shan.

113
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,220
I'll beat you to death!

114
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,880
You have a death wish.

115
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,530
Shan, stop! Shan.

116
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,870
Get up!

117
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,720
Get up!

118
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:27,750
Which hand did you hit Ying with?

119
00:06:32,190 --> 00:06:32,870
Shan!

120
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:33,630
Shan!

121
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:34,900
-I'll kill you.
-Shan! No, Shan!

122
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,159
-Shan!
-Don't stop me!

123
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,000
Shan, let go!

124
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:52,100
Gao, don't worry.

125
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:54,270
I've taken care of everything.

126
00:06:54,270 --> 00:06:56,130
The police will be here shortly.

127
00:06:57,270 --> 00:06:58,720
First, they'll document your injuries.

128
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,040
Then they'll lock him up.

129
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,500
Then he'll get sentenced.

130
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:05,750
Throw the book at him.

131
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:07,580
Right. Throw the book at him.

132
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,020
They should be here soon.

133
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,750
I'll meet them at the entrance.

134
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,000
You rest up.

135
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:15,450
What are you doing?

136
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:17,570
Quit gawking and crowding in here.

137
00:07:17,570 --> 00:07:18,500
Don't you have work to do?

138
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:19,830
Break it up! Go on! Go on!

139
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,680
Stop crowding around. Go!

140
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:24,240
Hey, Liu.

141
00:07:24,390 --> 00:07:25,500
The police

142
00:07:25,530 --> 00:07:26,310
should be here soon.

143
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:28,050
Go meet their car at the entrance.

144
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:28,600
Okay.

145
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,420
Why are you just coming back?

146
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:30,920
Didn't I tell you to secure the scene?

147
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,770
Just roping it off isn't enough.

148
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:35,290
How many times have I told you?

149
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,130
Zhang. Zhang.

150
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,870
Yes, it's me, Wang. Right.

151
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:42,610
Didn't I just

152
00:07:42,610 --> 00:07:43,820
call you?

153
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,520
I've already caught him.

154
00:07:47,390 --> 00:07:48,430
Are Liu and the others on their way?

155
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:49,070
Ying.

156
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,180
I'll be fine.

157
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,780
Anyway, he...

158
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,770
he won't get away with this.

159
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,360
Stay out of it.

160
00:07:58,830 --> 00:07:59,430
Ying.

161
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:11,050
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

162
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,830
Shan was wrong to hit you.

163
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,180
I apologize on his behalf.

164
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:19,810
Please let him off.

165
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,600
You know exactly

166
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,360
why he hit you, don't you?

167
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,750
If you won't let him off,

168
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,400
I'll tell everyone

169
00:08:38,429 --> 00:08:39,429
why he hit you.

170
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,909
Then,

171
00:08:41,909 --> 00:08:43,510
your wife will find out, too.

172
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,390
Hello, everyone.

173
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:54,720
I'm the supply department's

174
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,380
accountant, Chen Ying.

175
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,040
My brother Chen Shan was wrong

176
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,240
to hit someone today.

177
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,720
But he beat him that badly

178
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,200
for a reason.

179
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,030
Because...

180
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:04,960
Wait!

181
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,920
Wait, wait.

182
00:09:09,730 --> 00:09:11,580
I think Ying is right.

183
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:14,140
Her brother is still young.

184
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:16,350
We should give him a chance.

185
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,490
We can't ruin his future.

186
00:09:18,790 --> 00:09:19,910
You...

187
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,720
What a disgrace.

188
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,520
He beat me up this badly.

189
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:46,360
Don't worry.

190
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,990
Leave it to me.

191
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,330
Why don't we

192
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,840
report that Gao guy?

193
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,630
If I report him,

194
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:07,320
he'll insist on pressing charges.

195
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:09,080
If you get detained,

196
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,690
it'll go in your record.

197
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,150
Then,

198
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:16,160
it won't be worth it.

199
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,670
Ying.

200
00:10:21,510 --> 00:10:23,240
I don't care what happens to me.

201
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,510
But I can't just stand by

202
00:10:24,510 --> 00:10:26,570
and let him get away with hurting you.

203
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:32,670
Shan.

204
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,150
You're all I have left now.

205
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,150
I just want you to be safe.

206
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,520
What took you so long?

207
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,520
I've been waiting here forever.

208
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,600
The higher-ups have made it clear.

209
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,360
Your parents

210
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,000
were only allowed to stay here temporarily

211
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,390
when they were going through a hard time.

212
00:10:54,390 --> 00:10:56,080
It wasn't assigned as employee housing.

213
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,750
The plant is taking it back

214
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:59,120
to put it to another use.

215
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,930
What are you standing around for?

216
00:11:01,930 --> 00:11:03,330
Should I get some people

217
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:04,030
to help you move?

218
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,670
Don't push us too far.

219
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:07,600
My dad died in the line of duty.

220
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:08,700
And you're in such a hurry

221
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:09,440
to kick us out?

222
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,030
Don't put it that way.

223
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,700
I'm in a tough spot, too.

224
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,650
The eviction notice has been issued.

225
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:15,560
I can only do

226
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:16,910
what the bosses tell me.

227
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:18,790
You have two hours.

228
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:19,960
Get moving.

229
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:21,450
Do you understand?

230
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:48,180
Are you in or not?

231
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:48,910
Come on, are you in?

232
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:49,840
Are you in or not?

233
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,600
Why is that fish dead?

234
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:53,210
What dead fish?

235
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,040
I was seeing things.

236
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,440
Ying, play your cards.

237
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,100
Nine, ten, jack, queen, king.

238
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,170
You're out of cards again?

239
00:12:00,170 --> 00:12:01,550
Come on, stick it on! Stick it on!

240
00:12:01,550 --> 00:12:02,510
You're cheating!

241
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:03,150
No cheating! No cheating!

242
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:04,030
You're cheating!

243
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:05,360
You're all ganging up on me!

244
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,350
No cheating!

245
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:09,680
Come on, come on.

246
00:13:14,490 --> 00:13:15,670
[Fengxia's Convenience Store]

247
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:16,200
Ying!

248
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,320
Ying, over here! Here! Here!

249
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,000
Here! Here!

250
00:13:18,170 --> 00:13:20,400
[Fengxia's Convenience Store]

251
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:25,080
Come on. Hurry.

252
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,540
Give it to me. Give it here.

253
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,620
Look...

254
00:13:27,930 --> 00:13:29,530
You just showed up like this?

255
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:30,910
Give me your things. Give them here.

256
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:32,440
This way, this way. Come on.

257
00:13:37,510 --> 00:13:39,080
Put them down. Put them down.

258
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,940
Put them down. I'll open the door.

259
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,360
Come on in.

260
00:13:50,330 --> 00:13:51,270
Here, give me your things.

261
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:52,550
Give them here. Give them here.

262
00:13:52,550 --> 00:13:53,270
Just put them here.

263
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:54,000
Right here.

264
00:13:54,770 --> 00:13:56,660
Come on. Come on.

265
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,440
Wait here for me.

266
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,270
I'll go downstairs

267
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:01,730
and bring up your luggage.

268
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,230
Dad. Mom.

269
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:20,480
We've moved to a new home.

270
00:14:21,670 --> 00:14:22,670
Don't worry.

271
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:25,360
I'll take good care of Shan.

272
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,150
Mom.

273
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:31,080
I just don't understand...

274
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:33,940
why you

275
00:14:33,970 --> 00:14:35,650
had to leave us

276
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:38,630
this way?

277
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:49,430
Mr. Qi.

278
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:53,000
When I went to buy food,

279
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,870
there was a car parked downstairs.

280
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:55,840
I've seen the guy

281
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,470
sitting in it at the teahouse

282
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,870
with Wan Yang a few times.

283
00:14:58,870 --> 00:14:59,750
I'm guessing

284
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:01,000
Wan Yang sent him

285
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,200
to watch you two.

286
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:06,460
For the next few days,

287
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:07,740
let's stay put

288
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:09,640
and see what they're after.

289
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:10,550
Right.

290
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:12,080
Is he downstairs right now?

291
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,150
Yes.

292
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:15,390
-Shan.
-Shan!

293
00:15:15,410 --> 00:15:16,000
-Can you
-Shan.

294
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,080
stop being so impulsive?

295
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,670
He's gone too far.

296
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,820
Listen to me.

297
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:23,790
Eat.

298
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,360
Eat.

299
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,120
Eat.

300
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,360
Listen to Ying. Listen to Ying.

301
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,730
Come on, let's eat. Let's eat.

302
00:15:31,730 --> 00:15:32,530
Eat.

303
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,270
Mr. Qi, have a seat.

304
00:15:36,290 --> 00:15:37,490
Thank you. Thank you.

305
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,870
Let me do it.

306
00:16:10,050 --> 00:16:11,610
Wan Yang sent you, right?

307
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,680
Take me to him.

308
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,150
Mr. Qi.

309
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:40,790
Mr. Qi.

310
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,320
Mr. Qi!

311
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,830
Coming! Coming!

312
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:46,150
Is Shan here with you?

313
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,890
Why would he be here?

314
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:51,600
W-What's wrong? What happened?

315
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:53,080
Shan is missing.

316
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,200
W-What?

317
00:16:54,790 --> 00:16:57,130
Wait. Give me a second.

318
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:58,720
Chen Ying.

319
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:00,790
Shan.

320
00:17:02,670 --> 00:17:03,480
Chen Ying.

321
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:04,720
Chen Ying.

322
00:17:06,109 --> 00:17:07,190
Sir!

323
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:08,710
Sir.

324
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,310
What do you want at this hour?

325
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:12,440
I need to make a call.

326
00:17:23,109 --> 00:17:24,589
He isn't answering.

327
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:29,040
He won't answer my calls.

328
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:30,160
What do I do?

329
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:32,550
What if something happened to Shan?

330
00:17:32,930 --> 00:17:34,530
If something happens to him,

331
00:17:34,750 --> 00:17:35,640
