332
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:37,550
Chen Ying.

333
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:39,230
Don't panic just yet.

334
00:17:39,270 --> 00:17:40,190
He's a grown man.

335
00:17:40,190 --> 00:17:41,590
What could possibly happen to him?

336
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:43,270
Well, I'll stay with you.

337
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:43,750
I'll stay with you.

338
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:45,030
We'll wait for him right here.

339
00:17:45,030 --> 00:17:45,590
What if

340
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:47,070
he comes back soon?

341
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:47,900
Maybe

342
00:17:47,930 --> 00:17:49,360
he'll call you back soon.

343
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,000
Don't worry.

344
00:17:53,110 --> 00:17:54,200
Don't worry, okay?

345
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:56,000
Trust me.

346
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,350
He's got Master.

347
00:17:58,030 --> 00:17:59,430
Master will protect him.

348
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,640
Three of Characters.

349
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,440
Four bamboo.

350
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:08,070
Easy, bro.

351
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,590
Chen Shan!

352
00:18:13,650 --> 00:18:15,220
This isn't a place for you
to cause trouble.

353
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:16,350
Cut the crap.

354
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:20,070
Wan Yang.

355
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:22,340
You sent this guy, didn't you?

356
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:27,070
Is he from our plant?

357
00:18:27,090 --> 00:18:27,960
I don't know him.

358
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:28,680
I don't know him.

359
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,000
I don't know him.

360
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,130
I've never seen him.

361
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,200
What's your name? Do you know me?

362
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,880
I don't... I don't know you.

363
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:35,810
I don't know him.

364
00:18:37,030 --> 00:18:37,830
Get out.

365
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,030
Let's go.

366
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:45,720
Kid.

367
00:18:46,690 --> 00:18:48,290
You're being too impulsive.

368
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,590
If your wallet goes missing tomorrow,

369
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:52,750
