of stealing that, too?

370
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:54,240
Stop assuming the worst.

371
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:56,040
Go investigate.

372
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,160
Do your parents' deaths

373
00:18:58,310 --> 00:18:59,840
have anything to do with me?

374
00:19:00,750 --> 00:19:02,750
You've got enough family problems.

375
00:19:02,830 --> 00:19:05,030
You and Ying need each other.

376
00:19:05,550 --> 00:19:07,000
Life isn't easy.

377
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:08,270
Director Wan.

378
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,760
Don't play the saint with me.

379
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:13,240
I came here today to tell you this:

380
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:16,160
If you've got a problem with us,
take it up with me.

381
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,590
Leave Ying out of it.

382
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,000
If you dare send anyone else

383
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,240
to watch our family,

384
00:19:22,030 --> 00:19:23,830
I'll take down every one of them.

385
00:19:37,590 --> 00:19:38,410
How about finding someone

386
00:19:38,410 --> 00:19:39,610
to teach him a lesson?

387
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:42,350
Go back.

388
00:20:09,110 --> 00:20:10,790
I was at the pool hall last night.

389
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,400
I'm heading to my godfather's now.

390
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,160
Don't worry.

391
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:39,480
Shan's been found.

392
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,860
He was at the pool hall last night.

393
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,960
He's at his godfather's now.

394
00:20:45,110 --> 00:20:46,110
Okay, okay, okay.

395
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:46,830
It's good you found him.

396
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:48,030
It's good you found him.

397
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:49,200
Thanks, Mr. Qi.

398
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,640
You should hurry home and sleep.

399
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,270
Look at the time. Well,

400
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:54,240
you haven't eaten anything, have you?

401
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,030
How about

402
00:20:55,110 --> 00:20:56,510
I make you something to eat?

403
00:20:56,510 --> 00:20:57,440
Come on, come on.

404
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:00,880
Come on. Let's go.

405
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:10,790
Shan.

406
00:21:11,970 --> 00:21:12,480
Y-You're drinking?

407
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:14,640
Why are you drinking in broad daylight?

408
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,440
I just feel like drinking today.

409
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,750
You can't... can't drink like this.

410
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:20,400
Well...

411
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:21,880
Drinking like this
in the middle of the day

412
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:23,080
is bad for your liver.

413
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,290
I-I know you're upset,

414
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:26,960
but you

415
00:21:26,980 --> 00:21:28,690
can't keep sinking like this.

416
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:31,480
Godfather.

417
00:21:35,590 --> 00:21:37,070
So much has happened

418
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:40,280
to our family lately,

419
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,040
and there's nothing I can do.

420
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:45,960
I'm completely useless.

421
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,170
I-I think no matter

422
00:21:47,510 --> 00:21:49,400
how much you or I are hurting,

423
00:21:49,590 --> 00:21:51,120
Ying has suffered far more.

424
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:55,440
Both her biological parents
and adoptive parents—

425
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:56,550
your mom and dad—

426
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,240
have all left her, one by one.

427
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,600
Just think about it.

428
00:22:00,620 --> 00:22:02,070
Who could possibly bear that kind of pain?

429
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:02,790
Godfather.

430
00:22:04,550 --> 00:22:06,200
Do you know about Ying's

431
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:08,070
birth parents?

432
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,200
What really happened

433
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,730
in the northwest back then?

434
00:22:15,660 --> 00:22:16,440
It was just...

435
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,350
just an accident.

436
00:22:19,070 --> 00:22:20,590
With the kind of work you do,

437
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,550
no matter how careful you are

438
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:22,950
about workplace safety,

439
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,720
some accidents

440
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,120
are simply unavoidable.

441
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:27,830
When that incident

442
00:22:27,830 --> 00:22:28,830
happened,

443
00:22:30,070 --> 00:22:31,800
your parents were devastated.

444
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:32,750
They were in

445
00:22:32,750 --> 00:22:34,240
a terrible mental state.

446
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:36,070
And

447
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,510
Ying suddenly

448
00:22:37,510 --> 00:22:39,000
became an orphan.

449
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:39,880
She had no one.

450
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:41,860
That's when your parents

451
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:43,000
adopted her.

452
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,270
Honestly,

453
00:22:48,110 --> 00:22:49,170
even though you and Ying

454
00:22:49,170 --> 00:22:50,280
aren't related by blood,

455
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:52,000
you grew up together.

456
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:53,890
You're as close as real siblings.

457
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:56,130
So you... you have to take care of her.

458
00:22:56,790 --> 00:22:57,420
Because you're

459
00:22:57,420 --> 00:22:59,150
the only man left in the family.

460
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,340
No matter how

461
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:01,800
much pain you're in,

462
00:23:01,830 --> 00:23:02,620
or how much

463
00:23:02,650 --> 00:23:03,850
you've been wronged,

464
00:23:04,620 --> 00:23:05,740
you have to be strong for her.

465
00:23:05,740 --> 00:23:06,670
You understand?

466
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:11,210
Enough. You...

467
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:12,830
Y-You, you...

468
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:17,510
All right. All right.

469
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:17,920
Well,

470
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:18,960
let me... let me

471
00:23:18,980 --> 00:23:19,960
make us a few dishes.

472
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,510
I'll cook something for us.

473
00:23:20,510 --> 00:23:21,880
And then drink with you.

474
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:23,480
Stop drinking for now.

475
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:23,960
Wait here.

476
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,480
You can't just drink like that.

477
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:26,310
It'll hurt your health.

478
00:23:26,310 --> 00:23:27,440
All right? I'll drink with you.

479
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,700
I will drink with you.

480
00:24:02,590 --> 00:24:03,400
Thanks.

481
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:05,070
I didn't make too much.

482
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:06,860
Just have some of this for now.

483
00:24:23,270 --> 00:24:25,680
It tastes just like
the noodles Dad used to make.

484
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:26,700
Chen Fu noodles.

485
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:30,330
Your dad taught me how to make them.

486
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:32,540
When I first joined the plant,

487
00:24:32,590 --> 00:24:34,650
I barely had anything to eat or drink.

488
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:36,800
Your dad always made this for me.

489
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,640
Later, I met Master.

490
00:24:41,160 --> 00:24:42,560
He and his wife treated me

491
00:24:43,590 --> 00:24:45,160
just like their own son.

492
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:50,030
But they're both gone now.

493
00:24:52,270 --> 00:24:53,240
Actually,

494
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,640
my dad is gone, too.

495
00:24:58,950 --> 00:25:00,320
I know what you're

496
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:02,320
going through right now.

497
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,270
We'll

498
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:08,170
get through this together.

499
00:25:32,870 --> 00:25:35,050
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

500
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,600
You two, wait a minute.

501
00:25:40,830 --> 00:25:42,630
Where do you think you're going?

502
00:25:43,270 --> 00:25:44,930
