510
00:25:55,550 --> 00:25:57,730
I said no entry means no entry.

511
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:00,160
Didn't Zhang Wenying

512
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,370
have a student?

513
00:26:01,390 --> 00:26:02,030
How come he didn't come

514
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:02,790
with you?

515
00:26:02,790 --> 00:26:04,350
Did he cut ties with you

516
00:26:04,350 --> 00:26:05,200
to make it clear where he stands?

517
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,310
What's it to you?

518
00:26:08,070 --> 00:26:08,590
Right.

519
00:26:08,880 --> 00:26:10,140
It doesn't concern me.

520
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:11,720
But whether you enter this gate

521
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:13,000
does concern me.

522
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:14,160
As long as I'm here today,

523
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:15,480
you aren't getting inside.

524
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,200
Are you trying to drive us

525
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:17,310
to our deaths?

526
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:19,400
I'm going in today, no matter what!

527
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:20,030
I said you're not going in.

528
00:26:20,030 --> 00:26:20,830
Don't touch Ying!

529
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:21,400
Don't touch Ying!

530
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:21,880
Why won't you let us in?

531
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:22,400
So what if I touch you?

532
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:23,070
What are you doing?

533
00:26:23,070 --> 00:26:24,070
Why won't you let us in?

534
00:26:24,070 --> 00:26:24,550
Get out!

535
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:25,880
Close the gate! Close it!

536
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,270
You think you can just barge in here?

537
00:26:27,270 --> 00:26:28,600
Who do you think you are?

538
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,480
-What's wrong with you?
-You've gone too far!

539
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,270
What are you doing?

540
00:26:31,270 --> 00:26:32,270
So what if I kick you?

541
00:26:32,270 --> 00:26:33,720
Fine. Since you're making
such a scene here,

542
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:34,550
