543
00:26:34,550 --> 00:26:35,160
Come out if you're so tough.

544
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,000
Come on! Come out!

545
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:36,590
You people, leave.

546
00:26:36,590 --> 00:26:37,640
-Come out!
-Shan!

547
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,560
Fine. We'll wait this out.

548
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:41,960
Nobody's getting in today.

549
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,350
Come on, make way.

550
00:26:43,750 --> 00:26:44,400
Come on.

551
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,550
Speak of the devil.

552
00:26:51,550 --> 00:26:53,550
I knew you wouldn't stay out of this.

553
00:26:54,110 --> 00:26:54,920
Department Chief Wang.

554
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:56,310
Please open the gate.

555
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,270
You're quite a comedian.

556
00:26:58,270 --> 00:26:59,870
Is this any of your business?

557
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:02,200
This is Team Leader Pan,

558
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:02,880
a Party Committee member

559
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:04,590
of the Wugang Industrial Bureau.
He's leading the investigation

560
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:06,320
into the Project 713 accident.

561
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:08,740
[Notice of Special Investigation]

562
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,510
Please cooperate.

563
00:27:12,550 --> 00:27:13,700
Should we open the gate?

564
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:15,100
Open it. Open it. Open it.

565
00:27:19,450 --> 00:27:26,800
[Wugang Petrochemical
Gas Distribution Plant]

566
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,910
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

567
00:27:35,010 --> 00:27:36,610
Everyone, put your work

568
00:27:36,630 --> 00:27:37,400
on hold for a moment.

569
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:39,200
We're from the Project 713 accident

570
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:40,310
investigation team.

571
00:27:40,310 --> 00:27:41,810
We'd like to ask you some questions.

572
00:27:41,810 --> 00:27:42,980
Please cooperate.

573
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:45,030
Why are you still sitting around?

574
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:46,350
The shipment's here.

575
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,000
What are you waiting for?

576
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,550
Get moving and unload it.

577
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:50,710
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

578
00:27:50,710 --> 00:27:51,910
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

579
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:55,100
You're Mr. Sun Jie, right?

580
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:56,960
I am. And you are?

581
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,310
I'm from the Project 713 accident

582
00:27:58,310 --> 00:27:59,510
investigation team.

583
00:27:59,750 --> 00:28:00,590
My last name is Pan.

584
