There's been too much going on.

869
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,530
I was just feeling reflective.

870
00:39:11,230 --> 00:39:12,440
You've grown up.

871
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:26,800
You shouldn't deceive Ying like this.

872
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:27,650
Is it fair to Ying

873
00:39:27,650 --> 00:39:28,840
for you to do this?

874
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:29,630
Shan.

875
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,670
Stop talking about it.

876
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:33,060
We still have to carry on

877
00:39:33,060 --> 00:39:35,000
-with our lives!!
-How?

878
00:39:36,630 --> 00:39:39,090
You and Dad have lied to her
for so many years.

879
00:39:39,150 --> 00:39:40,520
Am I supposed to go along with you

880
00:39:40,520 --> 00:39:42,160
and keep lying to her, too?

881
00:39:47,070 --> 00:39:48,130
People can't spend their whole lives

882
00:39:48,130 --> 00:39:49,990
trapped in a bubble of sweetness.

883
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,190
If you live that way,

884
00:39:51,190 --> 00:39:54,120
you'll go through life
never seeing things clearly.

885
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:57,690
I'd rather face the truth,
however painful it may be,

886
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,510
than remain trapped

887
00:39:59,510 --> 00:40:00,660
in a beautiful illusion.
